  DTS:Description="Detects off-contract spend and contract leakage. Every purchase line is tested against the contract that should have covered it: no contract at all, a contract that had expired on the order date, a price above the contracted price, or an order placed with a non-preferred supplier while a preferred contract existed for the same category."
